    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d234">

                <pb facs="0300" n="240" xml:id="pg240"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Wos y Gil</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-02-12"><hi rendition="#italic">February 12,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 5th instant, inclosing a memorandum of the circumstances
                    which led to the rupture of diplomatic relations between the Dominican Republic
                    and France.</p>
                <p>The question has been made the subject of appropriate instructions to our
                    ambassador at Paris and chargé d’affaires near the Dominican Republic.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
